C  clusters: a transfer localised in bound systems
======================================================================================================================
  vacuum energy inside R500 / mean density inside R500 = Omega_L/500 = 1.370e-03; cold fraction needed (6.8x baryons) = 0.872
  -> converting ALL the vacuum energy in the volume gives 1.57e-03 of the cold mass: 636x short
